1. **Use Parameterized Queries**: Always use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection. Avoid directly embedding user inputs into SQL statements. For example, use:
   ```javascript
   const query = 'SELECT DISTINCT p.product_name FROM products p JOIN tags t ON p.id = t.product_id WHERE t.tag IN (?)';
   const products = await db.all(query, [tagList]);
